[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17880.948, "timestamp": "04:58:00", "text": "就是这样，然后我就进了那只兔子窝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17883.03, "timestamp": "04:58:03", "text": "对所发生的事情缺乏了解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17886.39, "timestamp": "04:58:06", "text": "当时我就想，哇！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17889.19, "timestamp": "04:58:09", "text": "我能理解他们的想法。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17891.03, "timestamp": "04:58:11", "text": "是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17892.628, "timestamp": "04:58:12", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17896.31, "timestamp": "04:58:16", "text": "每个人都想站在胜利的一方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17897.83, "timestamp": "04:58:17", "text": "即使获胜方实际上是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17899.91, "timestamp": "04:58:19", "text": "说谎。对，对，就是那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17902.55, "timestamp": "04:58:22", "text": "明白了。所以，然后[嗤笑]就有了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17905.75, "timestamp": "04:58:25", "text": "有些人真的给我发了邮件，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17908.55, "timestamp": "04:58:28", "text": "现在可以使用电子邮件了。还有一些呃……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17911.27, "timestamp": "04:58:31", "text": "因为Instagram的私信功能是开放的。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17913.99, "timestamp": "04:58:33", "text": "忘记关掉了。推特已关闭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17917.99, "timestamp": "04:58:37", "text": "Discord已关闭。 Facebook当时是开放的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17920.708, "timestamp": "04:58:40", "text": "呃，帖子是开放的。还有什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17923.51, "timestamp": "04:58:43", "text": "还有什么？ Tumblr。我当时正在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17925.59, "timestamp": "04:58:45", "text": "到处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17927.83, "timestamp": "04:58:47", "text": "你到处都能看到我。甚至"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17931.35, "timestamp": "04:58:51", "text": "我之前加入的 WhatsApp 群组"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17933.67, "timestamp": "04:58:53", "text": "呃，那是一个社区小组之类的东西。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17936.708, "timestamp": "04:58:56", "text": "Telegram 也参与其中。聊天室版本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17939.35, "timestamp": "04:58:59", "text": "它。"}]